  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/IMG_0813.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(32 fotos) El pub Flamenkito, en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110 de Onda, ha acogido la noche de este viernes un extraordinario concierto de la cantante La Meligrana, acompa&ntilde;ada por su grupo, con Mioara Ahicart a la guitarra. El local abre de jueves a s&aacute;bado desde las 22 horas hasta el cierre y ofrece guardarrop&iacute;a gratuito.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0748.jpg\" alt=\"img_0748\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0753.jpg\" alt=\"img_0753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0756.jpg\" alt=\"img_0756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0761.jpg\" alt=\"img_0761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0762.jpg\" alt=\"img_0762\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0764.jpg\" alt=\"img_0764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0766.jpg\" alt=\"img_0766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0768.jpg\" alt=\"img_0768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/meligranaflamenkito170217/img_0769.